concept:crimes-and-other-legislation-amendment-omnibus-sch-2-sec-9-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "9 Amendments made by Schedule 2 to the Crimes and Other"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-9-2 ;
    values:originalText "Legislation Amendment (Omnibus No. 1) Act 2024 The amendments made by Schedule 2 to the Crimes and Other Legislation Amendment (Omnibus No. 1) Act 2024 apply in relation  Schedule 3  Penalty unit  Crimes and Other Legislation Amendment (Omnibus No. 1) Act 2024 No. 93, 2024 to a notice given under clause 12 of Schedule 1 to this Act on or after the commencement of this clause: (a) whether currency, property or a thing to which the notice relates was acquired before, on or after that commencement; and (b) whether conduct or a crime to which the notice relates happened before, on or after that commencement." ;
    skos:definition "Legislation Amendment (Omnibus No. 1) Act 2024 The amendments made by Schedule 2 to the Crimes and Other Legislation Amendment (Omnibus No. 1) Act 2024 apply in relation  Schedule 3  Penalty unit  Crimes and Other Legislation Amendment (Omnibus No. 1) Act 2024 No. 93, 2024 to a notice given under clause 12 of Schedule 1 to this Act on or after the commencement of this clause: (a) whether currency, property or a thing to which the notice relates was acquired before, on or after that commencement; and (b) whether conduct or a crime to which the notice relates happened before, on or after that commencement."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "92fb4b6c22222cd9b25917bd3d72743a7639a6014808eeb91daa2c1dfa8c970e" ;
    cof:pageNumber "29"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Duty to provide information about acquisition of property or conduct" ;
    dc:description "Yes" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <crimes-and-other-legislation-amendment-omnibus.pdf> ;
