concept:crimes-and-other-legislation-amendment-omnibus-sch-4-sec-162 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "162 General application—Telecommunications Act 1997"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-162 ;
    values:originalText "Subject to this Division, the amendments of the Telecommunications Act 1997 made by this Schedule apply in relation to an exercise of power or the performance of a function or duty by a Communications Access Coordinator or a Communications Security Coordinator under that Act on or after the commencement of this Schedule." ;
    skos:definition "Subject to this Division, the amendments of the Telecommunications Act 1997 made by this Schedule apply in relation to an exercise of power or the performance of a function or duty by a Communications Access Coordinator or a Communications Security Coordinator under that Act on or after the commencement of this Schedule."@en ;
