    skos:definition "Telecommunications Act 1997 If a notice under subsection 314A(4), (5) or (5B), 314B(1), (3) or (5) or 314D(1), (3) or (5) of the Telecommunications Act 1997 was: (a) given on a day (the relevant day) before the commencement of this Schedule; and  Schedule 4  Communications Access Coordinator and Communications Security Coordinator"@en ;
