concept:crimes-and-other-legislation-amendment-omnibus-sch-5-sec-48 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "48 Subsection 5(1) (definition of member of the staff of the"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-5-sec-48 ;
    values:originalText "Inspector of the Law Enforcement Conduct Commission) Repeal the definition, substitute: member of the staff of the Inspector of the Law Enforcement Conduct Commission (NSW) means: (a) a member of the staff referred to in subsection 128(1) of the Law Enforcement Conduct Commission Act (NSW); or  Information sharing between integrity agencies and oversight bodies  Schedule 5  No. 93, 2024 Crimes and Other Legislation Amendment (Omnibus No. 1) Act 2024 (b) a person engaged, or whose services are used, under subsection 128(4) of that Act." ;
