    values:originalText "Repeal the paragraph, substitute: (f) in the case of the Crime and Corruption Commission (Qld)— a commission officer (within the meaning of the Crime and Corruption Act (Qld)); or  Schedule 5  Information sharing between integrity agencies and oversight bodies  Crimes and Other Legislation Amendment (Omnibus No. 1) Act 2024 No. 93, 2024" ;
