doc:sch-5-sec-62 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "62 Subsection 5(1) (definition of Parliamentary Inspector of" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "the Corruption and Crime Commission) Repeal the definition, substitute:  Schedule 5  Information sharing between integrity agencies and oversight bodies  Crimes and Other Legislation Amendment (Omnibus No. 1) Act 2024 No. 93, 2024 Parliamentary Inspector of the Corruption and Crime Commission (WA) means the inspector referred to in section 188 of the Corruption, Crime and Misconduct Act (WA)." ;
    cof:pageNumber "69"^^xsd:integer .

