    cml:logicSummary "Inspector must perform audit" ;
    cml:premiseText "Inspector of the Independent Commission Against Corruption (NSW) is responsible for auditing operations." ;
    cml:conclusionText "The Inspector must audit the operations of the Independent Commission Against Corruption (NSW)." ;
