concept:crimes-and-other-legislation-amendment-omnibus-sch-5-sec-76 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "76 Subsection 5(1) (after paragraph (i) of the definition of"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-5-sec-76 ;
    values:originalText "permitted purpose) Insert: (ia) in the case of the Inspector of the Independent Commission Against Corruption (SA): (i) conducting annual reviews examining the operations of the Office for Public Integrity (SA) established by section 17 of the Independent Commission Against Corruption Act (SA), and the Independent Commission Against Corruption (SA), during each financial year; or (ii) conducting reviews relating to relevant complaints (within the meaning of Schedule 4 to the Independent Commission Against Corruption Act (SA)) received by the Inspector of the Independent Commission Against Corruption (SA); or (iii) conducting other reviews on the Inspector of the Independent Commission Against Corruption (SA)’s own motion or at the request of the Attorney-General of South Australia or the Committee (within the meaning of Schedule 4 to the Independent Commission Against Corruption Act (SA)); or (iv) performing any other functions conferred on the Inspector of the Independent Commission Against Corruption (SA) by other laws of South Australia; or  Information sharing between integrity agencies and oversight bodies  Schedule 5  No. 93, 2024 Crimes and Other Legislation Amendment (Omnibus No. 1) Act 2024" ;
    skos:definition "permitted purpose) Insert: (ia) in the case of the Inspector of the Independent Commission Against Corruption (SA): (i) conducting annual reviews examining the operations of the Office for Public Integrity (SA) established by section 17 of the Independent Commission Against Corruption Act (SA), and the Independent Commission Against Corruption (SA), during each financial year; or (ii) conducting reviews relating to relevant complaints (within the meaning of Schedule 4 to the Independent Commission Against Corruption Act (SA)) received by the Inspector of the Independent Commission Against Corruption (SA); or (iii) conducting other reviews on the Inspector of the Independent Commission Against Corruption (SA)’s own motion or at the request of the Attorney-General of South Australia or the Committee (within the meaning of Schedule 4 to the Independent Commission Against Corruption Act (SA)); or (iv) performing any other functions conferred on the Inspector of the Independent Commission Against Corruption (SA) by other laws of South Australia; or  Information sharing between integrity agencies and oversight bodies  Schedule 5  No. 93, 2024 Crimes and Other Legislation Amendment (Omnibus No. 1) Act 2024"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "ada319f2e6dcf3cef90da68b77831570a20352563ee162814ddc4a5a8ba56eee" ;
    cof:pageNumber "74"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Conducting annual reviews and other functions" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
