concept:crimes-and-other-legislation-amendment-omnibus-sch-5-sec-194 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "194 Application provision—Inspector of the Independent"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-5-sec-194 ;
    values:originalText "Commission Against Corruption (SA) The amendments made by this Schedule apply in relation to an exercise of power or the performance of a function or duty by the Inspector of the Independent Commission Against Corruption (SA) that occurs on or after the commencement of this Schedule.  Schedule 6  Unauthorised disclosure of information by current and former Commonwealth officers etc.—sunsetting extension  Crimes and Other Legislation Amendment (Omnibus No. 1) Act 2024 No. 93, 2024" ;
    skos:definition "Commission Against Corruption (SA) The amendments made by this Schedule apply in relation to an exercise of power or the performance of a function or duty by the Inspector of the Independent Commission Against Corruption (SA) that occurs on or after the commencement of this Schedule.  Schedule 6  Unauthorised disclosure of information by current and former Commonwealth officers etc.—sunsetting extension  Crimes and Other Legislation Amendment (Omnibus No. 1) Act 2024 No. 93, 2024"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "0e1451b2c12240a41c14a58c6b9fa37b0b1c0083960b7665993938e89c972250" ;
    cof:pageNumber "91"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Amendments apply to Inspector of Independent Commission Against Corruption after commencement." ;
